        "filing_date": "2026-04-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Related Party Transactions—Our Relationship with SINA—Sales and Marketing Services Agreement.” We will continue to offer integrated solutions to customers with both SINA’s and our advertising and marketing solutions.",
