        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a media platform in nature, and major Chinese internet companies, such as Tencent and Bytedance, that provide online media, including content aggregation and distribution services, compete directly with us for user traffic and user engagement, content, talent and marketing resources.",
